轻倚在白色绒毛地毯上，左手自然搭在地毯边缘，姿态慵懒而从容。中景部分，她身后是一张深色沙发，沙发旁摆放着一个系有金色缎带蝴蝶结的黑色礼盒，暗示节日或庆典氛围。背景中，金色与黑色气球悬浮于空中，远处可见装饰着彩灯与星星挂饰的圣诞树，树顶点缀着金色星形装饰，上方悬挂着米色与白色三角彩旗，营造出温馨梦幻的节日氛围。窗外透入柔和的自然光，与室内暖光交织，使画面层次丰富。\n\n构图采用中近景特写，人物占据画面中心偏左，视线自然引导观众聚焦于她温婉的侧脸与精致服饰细节。画面采用柔和的暖色调为主，辅以黑色与金色点缀，光影层次细腻，营造出温暖、梦幻、略带节日仪式感的氛围。整体风格偏向于高质感艺术摄影，具有电影般的柔焦与细腻质感，仿佛由专业相机在室内柔和灯光下拍摄，画面充满故事感与情感张力，既日常又富有艺术深度，适合用于社交媒体、时尚宣传或情感类视觉内容。"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 395, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 258, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "125b3a4905ac9367f7aae5c2df67e2282f0a3d37", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.4.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 20}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "links": [509], "label": "LATENT", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "LATENT"}], "size": [270, 262], "pos": [348.7102355957031, 565.8739624023438], "widgets_values": [1046312042492518, "randomize", 5, 1, "dpmpp_2m_sde", "FlowMatchEulerDiscreteScheduler", 0.6000000000000001], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 495, "label": "model", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "model"}, {"name": "positive", "link": 496, "label": "positive", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "positive"}, {"name": "negative", "link": 497, "label": "negative", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "negative"}, {"name": "latent_image", "link": 498, "label": "latent_image", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "latent_image"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "steps"}, "name": "steps", "label": "steps", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "steps"}, {"widget": {"name": "cfg"}, "name": "cfg", "label": "cfg", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "cfg"}, {"widget": {"name": "sampler_name"}, "name": "sampler_name", "label": "sampler_name", "ty